{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":224097,\"title\":\"Our Game: LG Twins\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The LG Twins, a professional baseball team based in Seoul, has the largest fan base in Korea's sports history but is also considered an unfortunate team that has not raised a championship trophy for the last 28 years. The jewelry watch prize and the famous Japanese Awamori Soju (a premium alcohol beverage made from rice) that the GM from the 1994 winning team has vowed to present and open have become a legacy that no one has yet witnessed. There's even a painful nickname for LG Twins, \\\"a team destined to fail.\\\" However, for the 2022 season, two people from the 1994 winning team have stepped up to change the situation. The pitcher turned GM and the shortstop turned coach are the only people who remember the taste of victory 28 years ago.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l1a72Eq7vhmzj1IPjRkpMAqCH8p.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPiItBzANPbOCKzHuHC8lk1888f.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Reality\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"TVING\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KR\",\"name\":\"South Korea\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-04-27\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":75913,\"name\":\"Ha Jung-woo\",\"character\":\"나레이터\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9KINm0XIwbt4Qql4oZX55krzKxg.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"y_CfGOW0G78\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"SurqVmZfWYg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-Dh62isnig8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":224880,\"title\":\"Full Count\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gzrMSzURzOy7XcV31eQ5KyqBSk8.jpg\",\"ra